#: badend5:badend5_BBEF13A2_BB0F_4A79_B501_E9A68ED3ECA9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: db1486ad050e54712ffbbf587e9d996d23907bd4dac0a5cec61d95e6198a2ecd
#. default-sha256: bddd7c19010f3ce0aa7abfb454d15c42846f10952d328a87e5bd9b52096fdc61
msgctxt "badend5:badend5_BBEF13A2_BB0F_4A79_B501_E9A68ED3ECA9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫"
"You’ve made the right decision, Michel."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫Hai "
"preso la decisione giusta, Michel."

#: badend5:badend5_83564003_4394_490F_B68B_0F69DF183169
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7ff01d9b8b969762a2601bb2f1696d072dfdad5814d756b09ec3d1a65b499101
#. default-sha256: 66d9019de86b0f478c4691b50629ee4843fb6921b27554969656825f7f78607d
msgctxt "badend5:badend5_83564003_4394_490F_B68B_0F69DF183169"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Your tragic tale has finally come to an end."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫La tua tragica storia è finalmente giunta alla fine."

#: badend5:badend5_B76F5D6E_10F3_4739_9D24_003030A012AB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 077bceea8ceeaa50a7739d245aef164fa1800348eb3c05bdf26ba531e1457fc2
#. default-sha256: 7d6f10abc4323e66777fb674bb5dedcdf546c66c25bb8efa2b6df9f2d1607374
msgctxt "badend5:badend5_B76F5D6E_10F3_4739_9D24_003030A012AB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You’re free from the grip of this cursed mansion—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫free to begin your life anew."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Sei libero dalle grinfie di questa villa maledetta—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫libero di ricominciare la tua "
"vita."

#: badend5:badend5_B5231881_9804_4A29_9A8D_C27497A519D2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aa0afde228c6c746b6ecbe23b729d144883dcf2190d607f5f414c2a8a984d087
#. default-sha256: ac96d71de4d21d3abf351d1231bc6655aac2dd9d46e5aa5dc3b512e0b9cd2393
msgctxt "badend5:badend5_B5231881_9804_4A29_9A8D_C27497A519D2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I wish you a wonderful life,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ti auguro una vita magnifica,"

#: badend5:badend5_D76E6452_7102_4582_A162_5866DDAB8A55
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 926247118cf4cb564ea9735ac32ec120f363871b758dea0641b4c65fe3860cf7
#. default-sha256: dd4666c42d106647bb7c05831486b55d287116e3bb5bcfab985193817be519d7
msgctxt "badend5:badend5_D76E6452_7102_4582_A162_5866DDAB8A55"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫richly fulfilling and abounding in light."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫appagante e piena di luce."

#: badend5:badend5_60370D30_8D56_42CF_B457_4881616FC1D7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fb1aa94b1b47462304b972d6c43b0fbc7f804156092ebc0a794c17b3640bae17
#. default-sha256: 4ec77281a53b68edff32fdd90a854a5bd008dc3db98b7b01b746ec85e21e5ba5
msgctxt "badend5:badend5_60370D30_8D56_42CF_B457_4881616FC1D7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫For you, my dear friend, I will not cast a curse,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫but give you my utmost blessing."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Per te, mio caro amico, non lancerò una maledizione,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫bensì ti donerò la mia più "
"grande benedizione."

