#: badend5:badend5_5D7A5D26_0D02_4F27_98DD_7C5277A389E1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 833262f18cd6a3ac71a8efcdc36e13920794f2304dd907c1edd8dd21db4c72a2
