#: badend5:badend5_F770B190_B8F6_499E_8CEC_B78F26A93231
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 75c07b5c50069197432cebac2390901902e840f5283b24f8cf92f8416063ba77
